      "section": "4.4",
      "date": "2008-11-18",
      "orig": "         <xs:pattern value=\"0(.[0-9]{0,3})?\"/>\n         <xs:pattern value=\"1(.0{0,3})?\"/>",
      "correct": "         <xs:pattern value=\"0(\\.[0-9]{0,3})?\"/>\n         <xs:pattern value=\"1(\\.0{0,3})?\"/>",
      "notes": "As given, the pattern would allow values such as \"09\", which is not the intention.  The metacharacter '.' needs to be escaped."
    }
  ]
